<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Luca Benedetti — Filmmaker & Video Production</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Videomaker freelance a Sassuolo, Modena e Reggio Emilia. Video puliti, minimali e orientati alla chiarezza del messaggio." />
  
  <!-- Font Inter da Google Fonts -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0c0d0e;
      --card-bg: #141618;
      --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      --border-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      --text: #f0f0f2;
      --text-muted: #8e9297;
      --accent: #ffffff;
      --radius: 12px;
      --transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    /* Container */
    .container {
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    /* Navbar */
    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(12, 13, 14, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .nav-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      height: 72px;
    }

    .brand {
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .brand span {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 400;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    nav a {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      padding: 120px 0 80px;
    }

    .badge-loc {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .badge-loc::before {
      content: "";
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      background: #10b981;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.5vw, 4.2rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 680px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #0c0d0e;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #e2e2e2;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-color: var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
      border-color: var(--border-hover);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Stats strip */
    .stats-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin: 80px 0 100px;
      padding: 30px;
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .stat-item h3 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .stat-item p {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* Section Titles */
    .section-head {
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .section-tag {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: block;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    /* Video Portfolio Grid (16:9) */
    .video-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
      gap: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 120px;
    }

    .work-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .work-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-hover);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .video-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      padding-top: 56.25%; /* 16:9 */
      background: #000;
    }

    .video-wrapper iframe {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border: none;
    }

    .work-info {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .work-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .work-info h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .work-info p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    /* Vertical Reels Grid (9:16) */
    .vertical-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 120px;
    }

    .reel-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .reel-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-hover);
    }

    .reel-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      padding-top: 177.77%; /* 9:16 */
      background: #050505;
    }

    .reel-wrapper iframe {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border: none;
    }

    .reel-info {
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .reel-info h4 {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .reel-info p {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* Process / Services */
    .process-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 120px;
    }

    .step-card {
      padding: 32px;
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    .step-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-hover);
    }

    .step-num {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: inline-block;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .step-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .step-card p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* About Section */
    .about-box {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.3fr;
      gap: 60px;
      align-items: center;
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 120px;
    }

    .about-img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 440px;
      background: #1b1e22;
      border-radius: 8px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .about-text h3 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .about-text p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    /* Contact Section */
    .contact-wrap {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 60px;
      padding: 80px 0 120px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .contact-info h2 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .contact-info p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .direct-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .direct-links a {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .direct-links a:hover {
      color: #3b82f6;
    }

    form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .form-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .form-group label {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    input, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      transition: var(--transition);
    }

    input:focus, textarea:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: var(--text);
      background: #181a1c;
    }

    textarea {
      resize: vertical;
      min-height: 120px;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 36px 0;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .about-box {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 28px;
      }
      .about-img {
        height: 300px;
      }
      .contact-wrap {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 40px;
      }
      nav {
        display: none; /* Mobile menu essenziale */
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Header -->
  <header>
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <div class="brand">
        LUCA BENEDETTI <span>/ FILMMAKER</span>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="#lavori">Progetti</a>
        <a href="#social">Verticali</a>
        <a href="#metodo">Metodo</a>
        <a href="#chi-sono">Chi sono</a>
        <a href="#contatti">Contattami</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="badge-loc">Sassuolo · Modena · Reggio Emilia</div>
      <h1>Video che vanno dritti al punto.<br>Senza fuffa, senza drammi sul set.</h1>
      <p>Curo riprese, montaggio e ritmo per brand, aziende e professionisti che vogliono farsi capire al primo sguardo. E con un vantaggio non trascurabile: lavorare insieme non è un supplizio.</p>
      
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#lavori" class="btn btn-primary">Guarda i lavori</a>
        <a href="#contatti" class="btn btn-secondary">Parliamo del progetto</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Stat Strip -->
    <section class="stats-strip">
      <div class="stat-item">
        <h3>100%</h3>
        <p>Zero gergo tecnico incomprensibile</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <h3>1</h3>
        <p>Unico referente, dall'idea all'esportazione</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <h3>360°</h3>
        <p>Dallo storyboard ai formati per i social</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Selected Works (16:9) -->
    <section id="lavori">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-tag">Portfolio</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Progetti Selezionati</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="video-grid">
        <!-- Progetto 1 -->
        <article class="work-card">
          <div class="video-wrapper">
            <!-- Sostituisci con il link iframe del tuo video Vimeo o YouTube -->
            <iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/76979871?h=8272103f6e&title=0&byline=0&portrait=0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          </div>
          <div class="work-info">
            <div class="work-meta">
              <span>Corporate / Industria</span>
              <span>2026</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Racconto Industriale & Know-How</h3>
            <p>Sintetizzare il valore della produzione meccanica ed estetica in 90 secondi che tengono incollati allo schermo, senza annoiare.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Progetto 2 -->
        <article class="work-card">
          <div class="video-wrapper">
            <iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/76979871?h=8272103f6e&title=0&byline=0&portrait=0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          </div>
          <div class="work-info">
            <div class="work-meta">
              <span>Design & Architettura</span>
              <span>2025</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Superfici e Geometrie di Design</h3>
            <p>Luci radenti e movimenti camera minimi per esaltare i materiali ceramici e la precisione architettonica.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Progetto 3 -->
        <article class="work-card">
          <div class="video-wrapper">
            <iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/76979871?h=8272103f6e&title=0&byline=0&portrait=0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          </div>
          <div class="work-info">
            <div class="work-meta">
              <span>Brand Story</span>
              <span>2025</span>
            </div>
            <h3>L'Atelier Artigianale</h3>
            <p>Intervista senza copioni rigidi e dettagli ravvicinati del lavoro manuale per restituire autenticità e autorevolezza.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Social Reels (9:16) -->
    <section id="social">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-tag">Format Social</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Contenuti Verticali</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="vertical-grid">
        <!-- Reel 1 -->
        <div class="reel-card">
          <div class="reel-wrapper">
            <!-- Inserisci iframe Reel o video mp4 in loop -->
            <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          </div>
          <div class="reel-info">
            <h4>Dietro le quinte del set</h4>
            <p>Come gestire la luce naturale in 15 secondi.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Reel 2 -->
        <div class="reel-card">
          <div class="reel-wrapper">
            <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          </div>
          <div class="reel-info">
            <h4>Product Reveal Rapido</h4>
            <p>Dettagli macro e sound design ritmato.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Reel 3 -->
        <div class="reel-card">
          <div class="reel-wrapper">
            <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ" allowfullscreen></iframe>
          </div>
          <div class="reel-info">
            <h4>Pillola di Comunicazione</h4>
            <p>Perché i primi 3 secondi fanno la differenza.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Metodo / Servizi -->
    <section id="metodo">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-tag">Metodo</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Come lavoro</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="process-grid">
        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-num">01 / Concept</span>
          <h3>Capire prima di accendere la camera</h3>
          <p>Definiamo l'obiettivo, chi deve guardare il video e cosa scartare. Il segreto di un bel video è quasi sempre decidere cosa NON metterci.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-num">02 / Set</span>
          <h3>Sul set senza ansie</h3>
          <p>Luci controllate, audio limpido e una gestione rilassata delle persone: nessuno deve sentirsi sotto interrogatorio davanti all'obiettivo.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-num">03 / Editing</span>
          <h3>Sottrazione e ritmo</h3>
          <p>Montaggio chirurgico, sound design che sostiene il racconto e zero effetti speciali messi lì a caso per tappare i buchi.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-num">04 / Delivery</span>
          <h3>Consegna senza mal di testa</h3>
          <p>Color grading calibrata e file esportati pronti per l'uso: orizzontali per il sito, verticali per Instagram e LinkedIn.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Chi sono -->
    <section id="chi-sono">
      <div class="about-box">
        <!-- Sostituisci questo placeholder con il tag: <img src="tua-foto.jpg" alt="Luca Benedetti" class="about-img"> -->
        <div class="about-img">
          [Carica qui la tua foto ritratto: foto-luca.jpg]
        </div>
        <div class="about-text">
          <span class="section-tag">Chi sono</span>
          <h3>"Ciao, sono Luca."</h3>
          <p>Lavoro tra Sassuolo, Modena e Reggio Emilia con una convinzione semplice: la maggior parte dei video promozionali è troppo lunga, noiosa o concentrata sull'ego di chi sta dietro la camera.</p>
          <p>Il mio approccio è l'opposto: togliere il superfluo, far parlare il prodotto o la persona e costruire immagini pulite che rimangano impresse.</p>
          <p>Prendo il lavoro maledettamente sul serio — tempi rispettati, budget trasparenti, precisione millimetrica — ma non mi prendo troppo sul serio io. Se cerchi qualcuno con cui lavorare senza stress e farsi due risate a fine set, andiamo d'accordo.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contatti -->
    <section id="contatti" class="contact-wrap">
      <div class="contact-info">
        <span class="section-tag">Contatti</span>
        <h2>Parliamo del tuo prossimo video.</h2>
        <p>Hai un'idea o ti serve una mano a fare ordine? Scrivimi due righe. Rispondo entro 24 ore, anche solo per dirti onestamente se ha senso girare un video o no.</p>
        
        <div class="direct-links">
          <a href="mailto:ciao@lucabenedetti.it">✉ ciao@lucabenedetti.it</a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/393330000000" target="_blank" rel="noopener">💬 Scrivimi su WhatsApp</a>
          <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">↗ Instagram</a>
          <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">↗ LinkedIn</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Form Contatto -->
      <form action="https://formspree.io/f/tuo-id-formspree" method="POST">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">Il tuo nome</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Mario Rossi" required />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">La tua email</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="mario@azienda.it" required />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="message">Raccontami brevemente cosa hai in mente</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Che tipo di video vorresti fare, tempistiche o budget indicativo..." required></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 8px;">Invia messaggio</button>
      </form>
    </section>

  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>© 2026 Luca Benedetti — Filmmaker · Sassuolo (MO) · P.IVA 00000000000</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
